WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:02.544
I shot a ton of CEOs. 12 covers.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.045
This snake thing has got to be

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.130
the craziest origin story

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:05.672
I've ever heard.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:06.965
Honestly, it was boring

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.133
compared to what came next.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.135
We started our farm

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:10.885
in coastal Florida.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.178
We are thriving here!

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:13.722
We're prepared to purchase

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.514
your entire crop.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:14.973
What do you say?

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:17.142
Back! Back! Everyone back!

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.395
Jillian, back desk now!

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.229
I sign here.

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:23.690
We’re in business! No backsies!

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.192
The second our business

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.736
got even a tiny bit of success,

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.403
people showed up

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:28.987
trying to take it.

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:29.946
I want to talk to you

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:30.572
about a proposition.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.199
What happens if I say no?

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:37.120
Come on.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.371
What the hell?

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.414
Did you feed the gator?

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:40.040
Well, the thing

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.124
about Buttercup—

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:41.583
Don't name him!

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.418
And definitely not Buttercup!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.963
This creepy swamp family.

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:47.505
They screwed me over.

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.257
We split the profits.

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:50.467
80/20.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.551
Vanessa and Camille are

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.427
counting on me.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.012
I'd rather keep it aboveboard.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.096
Who are you?

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:55.889
I’m with the state of Florida.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.223
We’re shuttin’ you down.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:57.974
Don’t worry, guys.

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.517
You’ll keep getting paid.

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:00.852
And Margarita Monday

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:02.687
is still on.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:04.064
You can't promise them that.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:04.856
I already juiced

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:05.899
the limes, Craig!

00:01:08.526 --> 00:01:10.236
This is my farm. That I own!

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:10.695
Shut up!

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:13.948
I promise. There’s a plan.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:14.657
It won't be pretty.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.576
Let's go. Suit up.

00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:18.411
Dolores!

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.537
You have to wear underwear

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:20.580
in the common areas.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.790
The bathroom is a common

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.333
area and I’m naked there.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.501
Your rule makes no sense.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:26.503
We are building

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:27.170
a business here.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.130
No crimes, no scams.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.381
It's time we escalate

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:31.508
this situation.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.926
Sometimes in business,

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:33.760
people get hurt.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:36.971
What was that?

00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:38.431
Yeah! That was crazy!

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.182
Do you think I might be

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:40.391
repressing some anger?

00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:42.102
Yes, Jillian, I do think so!

